{"parentUuid":"bf3bc570-5737-4205-b555-c6bc9e2758ae","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfeDnwAmLDLWRT4ef5wPT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The demo slot now holds the live playground on a laptop and the video on phones. Reload http://127.0.0.1:8765/v3/ to try it.\n\n**On a laptop**, the frame first shows the playground under Skryn's own blur: gray square pixel blocks, labelled `⌃ Drag blur` in the corner. It has two buttons:\n- **Try it:** the blur clears over about half a second, the playground starts taking keys, and the tool bar from v2 appears under the window. Before you click, it ignores the keyboard entirely; I tested that a key pressed while blurred does nothing.\n- **Watch the video:** the frame switches to the video and starts playing. It keeps the crop frame and the `⌥ Drag crop` / `Esc remove crop` hints.\n\nA small link under the frame switches back and forth (\"Watch the video instead\" / \"Try it yourself\").\n\n**On phones and tablets** (anything without a mouse or trackpad), nothing changes: you get the video with the red play button, and the playground's screenshot is never downloaded.\n\n**Size:** on a laptop the first load goes from about 105 KB to about 150 KB compressed, mostly the screenshot (45 KB). On phones it's about 105 KB, with the playground code downloaded but never run.\n\nI tested it in WebKit at 1440 and 390px: no errors and no sideways scroll. Two things to check in real Safari, since scripted tests can't fully cover them: ⌃-drag for blur, and ⌘⏎ actually putting the PNG on your clipboard.\n\nThe video still opens with the old cat icon on its title card. It now only appears for people who choose to watch it, but the remake is still worth doing. If you'd rather go back, I saved the previous version of the page."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1444,"cache_read_input_tokens":426470,"output_tokens":929,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":357},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1444,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":929,"cache_read_input_tokens":426470,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1444,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1444},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"a925c180-c798-4c59-8d1c-04a316aee0e2","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CfeDnvbmxxzSdkAZL8cEw","type":"assistant","uuid":"b533e42a-10b7-4229-ba39-bd234355190f","timestamp":"2026-10-02T22:45:19.625Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","session_id":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn","sessionId":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"main"}
