> Flips the mark under the cursor, or the color you draw next.</p><span class=\"keys\"><kbd>C</kbd></span></div>","         </article>","         <article class=\"tool\">","           <div class=\"spec\" data-ink><h3 class=\"sr\">Capture time</h3><p class=\"note stamp\" id=\"stamp\">2026-09-30 12:00:00 UTC</p></div>"]},{"oldStart":631,"oldLines":7,"newStart":631,"newLines":7,"lines":["     <section class=\"wrap sec\" aria-labelledby=\"edit-h\">","       <div class=\"sec-head\">","         <h2 id=\"edit-h\">Everything stays editable.</h2>","-        <p>Nothing is flattened until you send it. Hover a mark to get its handles.</p>","+        <p>Nothing is flattened until you send it. Hover a mark for its handles.</p>","       </div>","       <div class=\"edit\">","         <div class=\"mock\" data-ink aria-hidden=\"true\">"]},{"oldStart":641,"oldLines":12,"newStart":641,"newLines":11,"lines":["           <span class=\"keybox\" data-mark=\"rect\" data-pad=\"7 7\" data-color=\"blue\" data-handles>ex_test_4hN8wC2vB6yD0sJ5</span>","         </div>","         <ul class=\"edit-list\">","-          <li>Move a mark: drag its body<span class=\"keys sm\"><kbd>Drag</kbd></span></li>","-          <li>Resize it: drag a handle<span class=\"keys sm\"><kbd>Drag</kbd><b>handle</b></span></li>","-          <li>Delete the hovered mark<span class=\"keys sm\"><kbd>⌫</kbd></span></li>","-          <li>Switch it between red and blue<span class=\"keys sm\"><kbd>C</kbd></span></li>","+          <li>Move a mark<span class=\"keys sm\"><kbd>Drag</kbd></span></li>","+          <li>Resize it<span class=\"keys sm\"><kbd>Drag</kbd><b>handle</b></span></li>","+          <li>Delete it<span class=\"keys sm\"><kbd>⌫</kbd></span></li>","           <li>Undo, redo<span class=\"keys sm\"><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>Z</kbd><kbd>⇧</kbd><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>Z</kbd></span></li>","-          <li>Edit text again: click it<span class=\"keys sm\"><kbd>Click</kbd></span></li>","+          <li>Edit text<span class=\"keys sm\"><kbd>Click</kbd></span></li>","         </ul>","       </div>","     </section>"]},{"oldStart":655,"oldLines":7,"newStart":654,"newLines":7,"lines":["     <section class=\"wrap sec\" aria-labelledby=\"send-h\">","       <div class=\"sec-head\">","         <h2 id=\"send-h\">Crop, then ⌘⏎ to copy.</h2>","-        <p>Three ways out, one keystroke each. Pick which modifier does what in Settings. Changed your mind? <span class=\"keys sm\"><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>W</kbd></span> closes the window without saving.</p>","+        <p>Three ways out, one keystroke each. Pick the modifiers in Settings. <span class=\"keys sm\"><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>W</kbd></span> closes without saving.</p>","       </div>","       <div class=\"send\" data-ink>","         <p class=\"note paste-note\" data-mark=\"arrow\" data-to=\"#shot\" data-gap=\"10\">This is what gets pasted</p>"]},{"oldStart":665,"oldLines":7,"newStart":664,"newLines":7,"lines":["         <ul class=\"outs\">","           <li><h3>Copy to clipboard <span class=\"keys sm\"><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>⏎</kbd></span></h3><p>Paste it straight into a chat, a ticket, a doc.</p></li>","           <li><h3>Save to a folder <span class=\"keys sm\"><kbd>⌥</kbd><kbd>⏎</kbd></span></h3><p>A PNG on your Desktop, or in any folder you choose.</p></li>","-          <li><h3>Upload, copy the link <span class=\"keys sm\"><kbd>⌃</kbd><kbd>⏎</kbd></span></h3><p>Uploads to Uploadcare with your own public key and puts the link on the clipboard. If an upload fails, the screenshot is saved locally instead.</p></li>","+          <li><h3>Upload, copy the link <span class=\"keys sm\"><kbd>⌃</kbd><kbd>⏎</kbd></span></h3><p>Uploads to Uploadcare with your public key and copies the link. If the upload fails, the PNG is saved locally.</p></li>","         </ul>","       </div>","     </section>"]},{"oldStart":690,"oldLines":7,"newStart":689,"newLines":7,"lines":["         <ul class=\"facts\">","           <li><b>One hotkey, your choice</b><span>⇧⌘5 by default. Record a different one in Settings.</span></li>","           <li><b>The display you're on</b><span>With more than one screen, Skryn captures the one under your cursor.</span></li>","-          <li><b>Drop an image on the icon</b><span>Drag an image file onto the menu bar icon to annotate it like a screenshot.</span></li>","+          <li><b>Drop an image on the icon</b><span>Any image file opens for markup, like a screenshot.</span></li>","           <li><b>Launch at login</b><span>One checkbox in Settings.</span></li>","         </ul>","       </div>"]},{"oldStart":705,"oldLines":17,"newStart":704,"newLines":17,"lines":["         <ol data-ink>","           <li><span class=\"badge\" style=\"--delay:0s\">1</span><span>Download <strong>Skryn.zip</strong> from the <a href=\"https://github.com/rsedykh/skryn/releases/latest\">latest release</a>.</span></li>","           <li><span class=\"badge\" style=\"--delay:.1s\">2</span><span>Unzip it and drag <strong>Skryn.app</strong> to Applications.</span></li>","-          <li><span class=\"badge\" style=\"--delay:.2s\">3</span><span>Open it. macOS blocks the first launch because Skryn isn't notarized: go to <strong>System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security</strong> and click <strong>Open Anyway</strong>.<small>On macOS 14, right-click the app → Open also works.</small></span></li>","+          <li><span class=\"badge\" style=\"--delay:.2s\">3</span><span>Open it. macOS blocks the first launch because Skryn isn't notarized: go to <strong>System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security</strong> and click <strong>Open Anyway</strong>.<small>On macOS 14, right-click → Open works too.</small></span></li>","           <li><span class=\"badge\" style=\"--delay:.3s\">4</span><span>Grant <strong>Screen Recording</strong> permission when asked.</span></li>","         </ol>","         <aside class=\"update\" aria-labelledby=\"upd-h\">","           <h3 id=\"upd-h\">Updating</h3>","-          <p>Since v0.1.6, Skryn is signed with a stable certificate, so Screen Recording permission carries over when you update.</p>","-          <p>Coming from v0.1.5 or earlier? The signature changed, so reset it once if screenshots stop working:</p>","+          <p>Since v0.1.6, Screen Recording permission carries over when you update.</p>","+          <p>Updating from v0.1.5 or earlier? If screenshots stop working, reset it once:</p>","           <ol>","             <li>System Settings → Privacy &amp; Security → Screen Recording</li>","             <li>Remove Skryn from the list</li>","-            <li>Take a screenshot. Skryn asks for permission again.</li>","+            <li>Take a screenshot; Skryn asks for permission again</li>","           </ol>","         </aside>","       </div>"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn/docs/index.html"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"9ae19739-2fcb-47f2-ba82-2298014b7663","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn","root":"/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn","branch":"main","default_branch":"main","status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":13,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"rsedykh/skryn","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"rsedykh/skryn","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"rsedykh/skryn","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9a7d780b-4d22-4c63-b0a2-47258d73a4ac","session_id":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn","sessionId":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"main"}
