{"parentUuid":"ac641f9b-b57a-430f-94a1-f1775629e0ae","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"32c572a3-7760-434f-840a-211109feeed6","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015oav3jDnHZV5b2z7c1QCuJ","type":"tool_result","content":"5:## Build\n13:## Lint\n19:## Test\n32:## Architecture\n58:## Cloud Upload (Uploadcare)\n76:## Distribution\n101:## What's new\n105:## Fixes\n116:**Screen Recording permission after update:** From v0.1.6 on, releases are signed with a stable certificate, so the permission survives updates. Updating from v0.1.5 or earlier (signed ad hoc) needs a one-time reset: remove Skryn from System Settings → Privacy & Security → Screen Recording, then re-add it (toggling off/on doesn't work).\n118:## Key Gotchas","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"6f12c1a5-014c-47c0-afac-499272b4a18a","timestamp":"2026-10-02T23:19:47.744Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"5:## Build\n13:## Lint\n19:## Test\n32:## Architecture\n58:## Cloud Upload (Uploadcare)\n76:## Distribution\n101:## What's new\n105:## Fixes\n116:**Screen Recording permission after update:** From v0.1.6 on, releases are signed with a stable certificate, so the permission survives updates. Updating from v0.1.5 or earlier (signed ad hoc) needs a one-time reset: remove Skryn from System Settings → Privacy & Security → Screen Recording, then re-add it (toggling off/on doesn't work).\n118:## Key Gotchas","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ac641f9b-b57a-430f-94a1-f1775629e0ae","session_id":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn","sessionId":"71183914-e83d-4503-afe0-4d46d21c5038","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"main"}
