{"type":"file-history-delta","messageId":"2aa5ee5c-63be-40b9-944c-2b1cfd7b0eea","snapshotMessageId":"3f9efb9d-bf0e-4c1f-b263-564dd2ea9973","trackingPath":"CLAUDE.md","backup":{"backupFileName":"02c447639dfe9f39@v1","version":1,"backupTime":"2026-10-02T23:20:00.060Z","realParentDir":"/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn"},"timestamp":"2026-10-02T23:20:00.061Z"}
{"parentUuid":"a7694fa2-c86f-4412-bde1-f071e613b401","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfeGSBnbT8WXDgzWmAbRt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Jkhr38qeUMAGcZbR19a4kc","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/rsedykh/GitHub/skryn/CLAUDE.md","old_string":"toggling off/on doesn't work).\n\n## Key Gotchas","new_string":"toggling off/on doesn't work).\n\n## Website\n\n`docs/` is the GitHub Pages site for skryn.app (served from `main` `/docs`, with `CNAME`). It's one self-contained `index.html` (inline CSS and JS, no build step, dark only) plus `docs/assets/`. The only external request is the demo video, hosted as a GitHub user-attachment.\n\n- **Marks** on the page are drawn by JS from `data-mark` attributes (`rect`, `ellipse`, `line`, `arrow` with `data-to`) inside `data-ink` blocks, so they follow reflow. Keep them in the app's style: 3pt strokes, 18pt arrowheads at ±30°.\n- **Demo:** devices with a fine pointer get a browser replica of `AnnotationView` behind Skryn's blur (`initDemo()`, `initPlayground()`); touch devices get the video. The replica copies the app's drawing (stroke widths, arrowheads, badge size, colors, blur block size `max(max(w, h) / 40, 10pt)`) and key handling, so change it together with `AnnotationView.swift` / `Annotation.swift`.\n- **Copy** only states what the app does: no \"free\", no \"open source\" (there's no LICENSE), no speed numbers.\n\n## Key Gotchas"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1543,"cache_read_input_tokens":544246,"output_tokens":1183,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1543,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iteration